---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`Risk Disclaimer | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="The information on this website is educational and informational only. It is not financial, investment, or trading advice, and trading involves substantial risk of loss."
		/>
		<style>
			main {
				width: calc(100% - 2em);
				max-width: 100%;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 2em 1em 3em;
			}
			.prose {
				width: 720px;
				max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
				margin: auto;
				padding: 1em;
				color: var(--text);
			}
			.title {
				margin-bottom: 1.5em;
				padding: 1em 0 0;
			}
			.title h1 {
				margin: 0 0 0.6em 0;
				font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.8rem);
				line-height: 1.15;
			}
			.rule {
				width: 56px;
				height: 3px;
				margin-bottom: 1.5em;
				background: var(--brand-yellow);
			}
			.prose p {
				line-height: 1.7;
			}
		</style>
	</head>

	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article>
				<div class="prose">
					<div class="title">
						<h1>Risk Disclaimer</h1>
						<div class="rule"></div>
					</div>

					<p>
						The information provided on this website is for educational and informational purposes
						only. Nothing published by AO Trading or the AO Team constitutes financial, investment,
						trading, legal, tax, or other professional advice, nor should it be understood as a
						recommendation to buy, sell, hold, or trade any financial instrument or digital asset.
					</p>
					<p>
						Trading financial markets, including cryptocurrencies, forex, and other leveraged or
						speculative instruments, involves substantial risk of loss. You may lose some or all of
						the capital you trade. Leverage can increase both gains and losses. You should only
						trade with capital you can afford to lose and should independently assess whether
						trading is appropriate for your circumstances.
					</p>
					<p>
						Past performance, historical results, examples, backtests, hypothetical scenarios,
						signals, and other performance information discussed on this website are not guarantees
						or reliable indicators of future results. Individual outcomes will vary, and actual
						trading results may differ from published or illustrative results due to execution,
						liquidity, spreads, fees, slippage, market conditions, timing, and other factors.
					</p>
					<p>
						Any trading signals, market observations, strategies, analysis, or commentary published
						by AO Trading are provided as information for the reader to evaluate independently. No
						representation is made that any particular result will be achieved.
					</p>
					<p>
						Where performance information or trade records are presented, readers should consider
						the methodology, time period, sample size, assumptions, and limitations involved before
						drawing conclusions from them.
					</p>
					<p>
						You are solely responsible for your own trading decisions and for conducting your own
						research and due diligence. Before making financial decisions, consider seeking advice
						from a qualified, appropriately licensed financial professional.
					</p>
					<p>
						AO Trading does not accept liability for losses arising from reliance on information
						published on this website.
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
